+  end:
+  milestones:
+    - date: 2019-09
+      label: FlexTech chair launched (CentraleSupélec & ESTIA); first INCOSE HSI conference, Biarritz
+    - date: '2020'
+      label: Human–Systems Integration — From Virtual to Tangible (CRC Press)
+    - date: '2021'
+      label: Design for Flexibility — a human systems integration approach (Springer)
+    - date: '2022'
+      label: PRODEC method for human–machine teaming design (Work, with Chloé Morel); socioergonomics / TOP triptych
+    - date: '2023'
+      label: An epistemological approach to human systems integration (Technology in Society 74); INCOSE HSI Primer
+    - date: '2024'
