+  French INCOSE chapter, which promotes human–system integration and human–machine teaming
+  as systems-engineering practice — the institutional channel through which Guy André
+  Boy's HSI framework reaches French defence programmes. On this map it stands for the
+  industrial application of HSI to mission systems where a crew supervises increasingly
+  autonomous functions.
